---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageShell from "@/components/PageShell.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Insurance & Rates | CC Counseling"
  description="How insurance and self-pay work at CC Counseling — coverage depends on your clinician and plan."
>
  <PageShell
    heading="Insurance & Rates"
    sub="Whether your insurance can be used depends on the clinician you work with and the health plans that clinician participates in. Before you begin, we can help you understand what may apply to you."
  >
    <p>
      When you reach out, we can walk through whether your plan is likely to be usable with your clinician match, what
      benefits verification may involve, and expected out-of-pocket costs. If insurance does not apply, we will explain
      self-pay so you can decide with clear numbers.
    </p>
    <p>
      Carrier lists and fee schedules on this page are updated when details change. To get information that matches your
      situation, contact us with your plan name and what you are looking for.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/contact-get-started">Get Started</a> · <a href="/">Back to home</a></p>
  </PageShell>
</BaseLayout>
